# Environment Variables

- Names: `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE`; prefix by service/scope when grouping
- `.env.example` — committed template + comments; no real secrets
- `.env` / `.env.*` — local only (gitignored); new var → placeholder + comment in `.env.example`
- Client (Vite): browser vars are `VITE_*`; read only via the shared env module
- Parse client env with Zod at module load; schema keys without the `VITE_` prefix
- Never put secrets / `service_role` in the client bundle; never prefix secrets with `VITE_`
- Do not read raw `import.meta.env` outside the shared env module
- Server: read `process.env` (no `VITE_` prefix); parse with Zod at module load in the server env module
- Never import server env into client code
